    <panel_attributes>Architecture Patterns
--
1. Layered Architecture:
   Presentation → Core → Infrastructure

2. Dependency Injection:
   FastAPI Depends() provides sessions
   Services receive Session via constructor

3. Service Layer Pattern:
   Business logic in service classes
   Controllers delegate to services

4. Repository Pattern (implicit):
   Services encapsulate data access
   No explicit repository interfaces
    Note: Repository layer optional; omitted for simplicity

5. DTO Pattern:
   Pydantic schemas separate API from ORM

6. Active Record (SQLModel):
   ORM models = DB tables

7. Factory Pattern:
   get_session() creates DB sessions

8. Clean Architecture Principles:
   - Core has no dependencies on outer layers
   - Infrastructure provides implementations
   - Presentation depends on Core
bg=yellow</panel_attributes>
