    <panel_attributes>University Marks Manager - Backend Architecture
--
FastAPI application with layered architecture following clean architecture principles.
Presentation Layer (API/Web) → Core Service Layer → Infrastructure Layer (Database).
Uses dependency injection, service layer pattern, and ORM (SQLModel) for data access.
bg=#e1f5ff
fontsize=16
halign=center</panel_attributes>
